t that she can shoot out up to par  with a nuclear explosion yeah pretty  powerful so I love that they're being  emphasized here so that's it for these  leaked photos I hope you all enjoyed  them it's always a treat because we  really haven't received anything for  Avengers for you yet just a couple of  photos so I hope this means that we're  gonna start to get more and more  concerning Avengers for let me know your  thoughts on these photos in the comments  below and don't forget to hit that like  button before you leave and subscribe to  my channel to stay up to date on  Avengers 4 thank you all so much for  watching stay classy Wolfgang  [Music]
 

